**"Software"** means the computer program known as Centra MCP (binary name `centra-mcp`), distributed by Centra in compiled, executable form only — including all binaries, archives, bundles (including `.mcpb` bundles), launcher scripts, embedded documentation and configuration templates, and any updates or new versions that Centra makes available under this Licence.

**"Centra Instance"** means an instance of the Centra platform operated under a valid agreement with Centra or a Centra group company.

**"You"** means the person or entity exercising rights under this Licence. If You use the Software on behalf of an entity (including as an employee, contractor or agency), You represent that You are authorised to bind that entity, and "You" refers to that entity.

